    "chunk_text": "re ylcan cyrican eallum limum astreht l\u00e6g & in his gebede \u00dea gelamp \u00f0\u00e6r sum wundorlic wise. \u00dea \u00fea re\u00f0an & \u00fea wedendan Francan inneodon, hi spurnon mid heora fotum on \u00feone halgan wer, & swa hi mid blindnesse gedwealde wurdon, \u00fe\u00e6t hi eft of \u00feam mynstre idelh\u00e6nde hwurfon. Eac swilce on o\u00f0re tid gelamp, \u00fe\u00e6t he for \u00f0\u00e6s mynstres \u00feingan, \u00fee he mid \u00fe\u00e6s abbudes h\u00e6se & \u00fea so\u00f0lice for lufan \u00fe\u00e6s arwur\u00f0an, swa hwider swa he Libertinus ferde, symble he h\u00e6fde & witodlice, \u00fea he on his weg ferde, \u00fea gelamp, \u00fe\u00e6t sum wif b\u00e6r hire sunu deadne ong\u00e6n \u00feam \u00dea f\u00e6ringa wear\u00f0 heo on\u00e6led for lufan hire \u00fe\u00e6s deadan suna, & heo \u00fea genam \u00fe\u00e6s halgan mannes & he \u00fea se Godes wer ongan \u00feencan, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feyllic wundor w\u00e6re mannum ungewunelic to wyrcanne, Ac nu me fealh on mode, Petrus, \u00fe\u00e6t me lyste\u00fe sceawian & smeagean, hulic & hu mycel se camp Him w\u00e6s mycel ege to \u00feon, \u00fe\u00e6t he huru to swy\u00f0e ne ny\u00fede, gif he \u00fe\u00e6s ungewunelican \u00feinges to Ac \u00fea to maran wuldre \u00f0am \u00e6lmihtigan Gode seo arf\u00e6stnys oferswy\u00f0de \u00feone strangan breost, Ac he gelihte of his horse & his cneow gebigde & his handa a\u00feenede upp to heofonum & \u00feone & \u00fea him gebiddendum seo sawl \u00fe\u00e6s cnihtes gehwearf eft to \u00feam lichaman.",
